cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Quantum-QKD-Aero: a verified quantum-link simulator"
abstract: >-
  A Python research sandbox for quantum key distribution and quantum
  teleportation over satellite free-space and optical fibre channels. Physical
  quantities are computed from first principles and checked against analytic
  truths or structural invariants, under enforced provenance tagging and a
  medium/topology/protocol channel model. Implements decoy-state BB84 with
  Lo-Ma-Chen bounds and GLLP key rates, Werner-state teleportation fidelity,
  CHSH violation, a photon-number-splitting eavesdropper, and background-light
  coherence degradation.
type: software
